@title Live view: Why? on a coil whose return wire is missing names the other side of the supply
@area Schematic
@sizes 1920x1080
# LSC-03: a coil that can never pull in because its second pin is wired to nothing got only a generic
# "dead" line. Why? now names the other side of the supply and what to wire.
open qa/fixtures/coil-open-return.novo
wait 30
key shift+l
wait 20
try click_text "Go to page 2 Control circuit"
wait 20
shot live-control-page
click_text "Why?"
wait 10
click 560 632
wait 10
expect "to the other side of the supply"
shot why-coil
check_layout
